the complainers.

00:00:03.469 --> 00:00:05.906
I'm not upset with you play
video games all day or

00:00:05.906 --> 00:00:07.341
watch Netflix all night.

00:00:07.341 --> 00:00:09.877
I'm mad at you if you're doing
that and you're baffled why

00:00:09.877 --> 00:00:12.246
you're not making more
money and living your dream.

00:00:12.246 --> 00:00:14.414
If you're happy and
content, you've won.

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:16.984
But if you're complaining it
means you haven't won yet and

00:00:16.984 --> 00:00:20.020
you should stop complaining and
do some thing about it instead.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.829
Someone I look up to 
most in the world,

00:00:22.829 --> 00:00:25.225
tied with you Dad, 
is my mother.

