most intriguing thing about my

00:00:30.828 --> 00:00:33.200
mother is her
inability to complain.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.802
It's probably one of my 
favorite traits that

00:00:34.802 --> 00:00:35.992
she's passed on to me.

00:00:35.992 --> 00:00:38.839
I find it incredibly attractive
and it's a quality that I adore

00:00:38.839 --> 00:00:40.107
in my wife as well.

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:42.676
It's even something I to try and
instill in my children because

00:00:42.676 --> 00:00:44.537
I think complaining is ugly.

00:00:44.537 --> 00:00:46.680
Personally, I don't complain.

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:48.448
